<title>USA: Avalon Community opens center in Colorado.</title>
<headline>Avalon Community opens center in Colorado.</headline>
<dateline>OKALHOMA CITY, Okla. 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avalon Community Services Inc said Monday it opened the Diamond Crest Assisted Living Center, a new assisted living center for the elderly in Fort Collins, Colo.</p>
<p>Construction was completed last week on phase one of the center with accomodations for 40 residents, it said. A second phase to expand Diamond Crest to 64 beds is scheduled to be completed in 1997.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
